{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>And he took portions from before him.</b> They would bring the dishes before him first, to see that they were fitting, and <b>from before him</b> — from before Joseph — they would carry them <b>to them.</b> [<b>משאת</b> — the language of a gift.] And Benjamin's portion multiplied, because he came at his command." "<b>And they drank with him.</b> For they had not yet decreed upon their general wine (stam yenam)."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:08:32.005081498Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}